      "comment": "CHARLENES DELIGHT (9) had been racing very well before landing a well-deserved win last start, coming from a wide barrier and scoring by a head at Newcastle on Monday. Hard to know where he gets to from this awkward draw but with even luck he can make it two on the trot. DYNAMITE DANNI (5) came from wider than this to win at Newcastle last month and has been going well since, finishing second in three of four subsequent starts. Raced parked from this barrier when only beaten 2 metres here last week. Major player. LOUTHPARKSCHOONER (2) enjoyed a better barrier when finishing second here last time and draws to play a role again. HUNGRY JOE (1) has been coming from wider or second line barriers of late. The ace draw gives him every chance to show his best.",
